Scenario: View Hungary data access file with no personal data as employees
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	All employees in data access groups should be able to view links to large attachments with no personal data to a ticket uploaded by a customer in the Hungary region

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create a user with the following parameters
	| Screen Name   | lfa.customer1                       |
